Hiking App

A Kivy-based mobile application for hill bagging in the UK. The app allows users to track climbs across different mountain classifications, either by manually recording a climb or by using the phone's GPS to log a summit automatically.

Features

Interactive map showing mountain locations

GPS-based summit logging

Manual climb recording

Distance and bearing to nearby mountains

Climb history

Tracking across different UK mountain classifications

Technologies

Python

Kivy

SQLite

Plyer

Project Status

This is an active personal project. The core application is working, with additional features and improvements still being developed.

Installation

Clone the repository:

git clone <repository-url>
cd <repository-folder>

Install the required Python packages:

pip install -r requirements.txt

Run the application:

python main.py

The application uses mobile-device functionality such as GPS, so some features require a compatible device and appropriate permissions.
